{"id":"wa_hren","lemma":"währen","pos":"verb","rank":3865,"glosses":["to last, persist"],"ipa":"/ˈvɛːʁən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fc/De-w%C3%A4hren.ogg/De-w%C3%A4hren.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"währe","1p":"währen","2s":"währst","2p":"währt","3s":"währt","3p":"währen"},"preterite":{"1s":"währte","1p":"währten","2s":"währtest","2p":"währtet","3s":"währte","3p":"währten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe gewährt","1p":"haben gewährt","2s":"hast gewährt","2p":"habt gewährt","3s":"hat gewährt","3p":"haben gewährt"},"future":{"1s":"werde währen","1p":"werden währen","2s":"wirst währen","2p":"werdet währen","3s":"wird währen","3p":"werden währen"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"währ","2p":"währt"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde währen","1p":"würden währen","2s":"würdest währen","2p":"würdet währen","3s":"würde währen","3p":"würden währen"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"gewährt"},"examples":[{"text":"Nichts währt ewig.","en":"Nothing is forever.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/79098","words":[{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"eternally, for ever"}]},{"text":"Die Ruhe währte nicht lange.","en":"The calm didn't last for long.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"calm"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"long, for a long time"}]},{"text":"Diese gute Zeit wird nicht lange währen.","en":"These good times won't last long.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},null]},{"text":"Der Regen währte die ganze Nacht.","en":"The rain lasted the whole night.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"rain"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},{"g":"night"}]},{"text":"Unsere Liebe wird ewig währen.","en":"Our love will last forever.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"eternally, for ever"},null]}]}